# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist-ssr
*.local
# dist/ is deliberately tracked, not ignored -- see epk-back's
# docs/cpanel-deployment.md (committing the build lets the deploy target
# `git pull` this repo directly, no Node.js needed on the server). It's SSR
# builds (dist-ssr) that stay ignored here; this project doesn't use SSR at
# all, kept only in case a future `vite build --ssr` run produces one.

